Betadine Wound Solution 60mL
&#xD;
Betadine solution is a common antiseptic and antibacterial agent that is regularly used in human medicine for a number of purposes. Its portability and ease of use make it a great choice for people who are on the go; it's a favorite of outdoor enthusiasts, mountain bikers, hikers and others. Betadine can be used for the same purposes for dogs as well.
&#xD;
Direction for Use:
Clean and dry affected skin area. Swab wound gently with cotton. It may be covered with gauze or adhesive bandage. When color fades or vanishes re-apply solution. (The golden brown color of Providone-iondine (Betadine) indicates its germ-killing action).

